answers:
Okay I was missing withComponentInputBinding() as second param of provideRouter
As following
provideRouter(
  [
    {
      path: '**',
      component: MyComponent,
      data: { dataA: 'My static data' },
      resolve: { resolveA: () => 'My resolved data' },
    },
  ],
  withComponentInputBinding()
),

